/* The Booking Form Check List, blank - the same bytes as booking-check-list-blank.pdf beside
   this file, base64'd into a script.

   Why not just fetch the PDF: a browser refuses fetch() of a same-origin file when the page
   itself was opened from the disk as file://, and throws "Failed to fetch" before making any
   request - so the check list could not be built at all while working locally. A script tag is
   allowed in both places. Loaded on demand, not on every page load.

   Regenerate with scratchpad/mkblankjs.py if the blank form itself ever changes - and re-measure
   WF_CL in accountability.js if its layout changed, not just its content. */
window.WF_CL_BLANK_B64="";
